      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RUN THE GAUNTLET (1) was strongly fancied last time on the back of some superb recent form, including a two-run winning streak, but could only manage third (30.89) at Q Lakeside. Goes very well from this draw with three wins and three minor placings from seven starts. Top chance in this line up. CLASSY HUNTER (8) is a strong stayer who excels over the longer races. Was a strong winner last time (41.39) over 710m at this track in a Grade 5/6. Has never been out of the money in three starts this course and distance. Ran the fastest time on the program in her latest win. Sure to measure up. ROMA KEEPING (7) hasn't been far away, finishing in the money twice in a row including last time in a OPEN at Q Lakeside over 550m. Can improve sharply here. STARFIRE TEARS (4) should be thereabouts despite an unplaced run here most recently.",
